            ['Motivation only about shifts', 'Overstating language level'],
            'I love the idea that the welcome is the first memory of a stay. I speak fluent French and good Spanish. During a season in a seaside hotel I welcomed guests from many countries and learned to adapt my style: more formal with some, more relaxed with others. I would like to bring this sense of service to your hotel.',
