            ['Hinting at information', 'Answering hurtfully'],
            'I tactfully tell them I cannot discuss matters I know about through my role, because confidentiality is part of the job. I understand their worry and invite them to ask their manager or wait for leadership\'s official communication. I give everyone the same answer and neither confirm nor deny any rumour. If I sense strong concern in the teams, I let leadership know so they can adapt their communication.',
            'confidential,worry,official communication,same answer'],
    ],
